sequenceDiagram
  participant S as Domain service
  participant DB as Service DB
  participant R as Outbox relay
  participant B as Broker
  participant C as Consumer
  participant CD as Consumer DB
  S->>DB: BEGIN; mutate aggregate + insert outbox; COMMIT
  R->>DB: read unpublished outbox
  R->>B: publish event id
  B-->>R: ack
  R->>DB: mark published
  B->>C: deliver event (may repeat)
  C->>CD: BEGIN; insert inbox unique(source,id)
  alt fresh event
    C->>CD: apply authorized business effect
  else already processed
    C->>CD: no additional effect
  end
  C->>CD: COMMIT
  C-->>B: ack
